OL,3,GGrampian                               
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FIt will be a 
OL,6,Fdry evening, some clear spells, frost  
OL,7,Freturning in more sheltered areas but  
OL,8,Foverall southeasterly winds will be    
OL,9,Fstrengthening with temperatures        
OL,10,Flifting above freezing.                
OL,12,CTuesday:FA bright start in Buchan and  
OL,13,Fnortheast, otherwise cloudy with       
OL,14,Foutbreaks of rain developing, this     
OL,15,Flight and patchy over Moray and Banff  
OL,16,Fbut heavier across southern            
OL,17,FAberdeenshire, hill snow. Windy.       
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
